  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e07-scene-15",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "真诚道歉的那杯酒  (Drinking to Make Peace)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "kaiwen": "凯文",
    "chun_yuqiao": "淳于乔"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "To unite Xingtian's fractured departments after his promotion, Chun Yuqiao goes to meet the rival unit directors at a private lounge despite his severe stomach ailment, with worried Kaiwen hurrying in behind him. Listen to their Mandarin lines first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "老大那个酒量，喝多了身体根本受不了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "上次他在路边难受成那样，还是我把他扛回去的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "孙总，我按约过来了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "非常感谢孙总的诚意，大家都请坐吧。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "今天我过来，其实也是想跟各位说一下心里话。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "关于最近工作上的这件事，我想向各位真诚地道个歉。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "以后各部门还要一起做节目，这杯酒我敬你。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "孙总，你是知道的，我们淳于总真的喝不了酒。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "这杯酒我替他喝！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "凯文，你闭嘴，坐下。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "他有严重的胃病，真的喝不了烈酒！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "老大，你这样硬喝不要命了吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "没关系，这杯酒应该我亲自喝。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "老大那个酒量，喝多了身体根本受不了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'With our boss's low alcohol tolerance, his body cannot handle heavy drinking at all.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "上次他在路边难受成那样，还是我把他扛回去的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Last time he got sick by the roadside, I was the one who carried him home.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "孙总，我按约过来了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Mr Sun, I am here as promised.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "非常感谢孙总的诚意，大家都请坐吧。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Thank you very much for your sincerity, Mr Sun; please have a seat, everyone.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "今天我过来，其实也是想跟各位说一下心里话。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I came tonight because I wanted to speak candidly with all of you too.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "关于最近工作上的这件事，我想向各位真诚地道个歉。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Regarding our recent work disputes, I want to offer all of you a sincere apology.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "以后各部门还要一起做节目，这杯酒我敬你。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'All our units will be making shows together from now on, so I toast you with this glass.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "孙总，你是知道的，我们淳于总真的喝不了酒。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Mr Sun, you know very well that Mr Chun Yuqiao cannot drink alcohol.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "这杯酒我替他喝！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Let me drink this glass in his place!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "凯文，你闭嘴，坐下。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Kaiwen, keep quiet and sit down.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "他有严重的胃病，真的喝不了烈酒！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'He has a serious stomach condition and truly cannot drink strong liquor!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "老大，你这样硬喝不要命了吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Boss, are you risking your life forcing down drinks like this?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "没关系，这杯酒应该我亲自喝。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'It is fine; I ought to drink this glass myself.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "老大那个酒量，喝多了身体根本受不了。",
      "gap": 0.5
